   <div class="dataset-copy"><h3>From videos to<br>multimodal motion.</h3><p>OmniHuMo turns diverse online videos into a corpus of <strong>3.2 million human motion sequences</strong>, spanning 5,048 hours of movement.</p><p>Every sequence is paired with <strong>1–3 text captions</strong>. An approximately 500-hour subset also includes temporally aligned speech or music, enabling learning across semantics, rhythm, and motion.</p><a class="inline-link" data-link="dataset" href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/L-yiheng/OmniHuMo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore OmniHuMo on Hugging Face ↗</a></div></div>
 
